<title>USA: Westamerica ValliCorp deal approved.</title>
<headline>Westamerica ValliCorp deal approved.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAFAEL, Calif. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westamerica Bancorporation and ValliCorp Holdings Inc on Tuesday said shareholders of both companies have approved the merger of ValliCorp into Westamerica in a tax-free stock swap.</p>
<p>Over 98 percent of the Westamerica shares voted approved the proposed merger and about 97 percent of the ValliCorp shares favored the deal, the companies said in a statement.</p>
<p>The merger is currently expected to close during the second quarter of 1997, subject to a regulatory approval and certain other conditions.</p>
</text>
